{"id":"u-9a6ec171-7130-4fb7-8202-6fcf3528124e","src":"community","title":"Precision Hypertrophy Split","author":"Dan Cabalida","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/OVTIqI-fbeod","desc":"This 3-day hypertrophy system is designed to minimize muscle overlap and fatigue interference, allowing each muscle group to be trained with greater intensity, focus, and quality. Instead of constantly working muscles that are already tired from previous exercises, PHS strategically organizes training so that your target muscles are fresher when it's time to train them.\n\nThe result is better exercise performance, more productive sets, improved recovery, and a stronger growth stimulus where it matters most. Whether you're looking to build a balanced physique, break through plateaus, or simply get more out of every set, this split helps you train with purpose rather than accumulating unnecessary fatigue.\n\nIf you've ever felt like your performance is limited by tired supporting muscles instead of the muscle you're actually trying to grow, the Precision Hypertrophy Split was built for you.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":100,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-06-29T11:06:58.631Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"standing multi-flight machine","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":0}]},{"n":"Russian Twist (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]},{"n":"Reverse Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":0}]},{"n":"Seated Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]},{"n":"Single Arm Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":0}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]},{"n":"Kelso Shrug (Chest Supported)","sets":[{"r":0}]},{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]},{"n":"Seated Ha